      <Comment source="THE-ARABIDOPSIS-INFORMATION-RESOURCE, zhang">The Arabidopsis gamma-glutamyl peptidase GGP1 (At4G30530) was expressed in E. coli. The recombinant protein was purified. In vitro assay proved enzyme activity with the glutathione-conjugate substrate. In planta, GGP1 is highly co-expressed with the other glucosinolate biosynthetic genes CYP83B1 and SUR1.</Comment>
